{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29185","headline":"寄当涂李远 · 许浑","name":"寄当涂李远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赋拟相如诗似陶，云阳烟月又同袍。\n车前骥病驽骀逸，架上鹰闲鸟雀高。\n旧日乐贫能饮水，他时随俗愿餔糟。\n不须倚向青山住，咏雪题诗用意劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}